<Image src="https://images.vialoops.com/clo3frr4v02f0jv0qztu2pxpb/cmughqzy578ix0iwyev56gq0j.png" alt="Hack Club" width="120" paddingBottom="16" />
<H1 paddingBottom="16">We're taking a closer look</H1>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">Hi {data.signer_fullName},</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">Thanks for sending over your existing NDA. A couple of details didn't line up neatly enough for us to file it automatically, so someone at Hack Club will review it by hand.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="16" lineHeight="165" paddingBottom="16">You don't need to do anything else. We'll message you on Slack when it's done.</Paragraph>
<Button paddingTop="8" paddingBottom="24" href="{data.nda_importUrl}">Check the status</Button>
<Paragraph fontSize="13" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="16">Or paste this link into your browser:<Br />{data.nda_importUrl}</Paragraph>
<Paragraph fontSize="14" lineHeight="160" paddingBottom="8">Reviews usually take a day or two. If you'd rather not wait, you can sign a fresh NDA from the same page.</Paragraph>
<Divider width="100" paddingTop="16" paddingBottom="16" />
<Paragraph fontSize="12" lineHeight="170"><Strong>The Hack Foundation</Strong>, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit<Br />212 Battery St., Shelburne, VT 05401, USA<Br />This message concerns a legal agreement. Keep it for your records.</Paragraph>
